I don't know if this has been suggested before or not, but what do people
think of having Larn-style monster names in Nethack?  Specifically, what
I mean is that there is a file in Larn which describes a correspondence
between the letters appearing on the screen and the name of the monster they
represent.  For example, if you don't think 'imp' is a good enough name for
an 'i', you can call 'i' an 'icky thing' instead (just like it is in Moria).
I think that's a fun little feature to have (and who can call it a bug?)

